  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Heritage-inspired designed with lightweight fabric upper supported with synthetic leather overlays\n\tHigh profile with padded tongue and collar for comfortable support\n\tLace panel secured with hook-and-loop strap for a locked-in wear\n\tSporty branding for a legendary vibe\n\tWebbed pull tabs offer an easy-on and off\n\tProtective mudguard at the round toe\n\tVisible Max Air-Sole unit and padded midsole for light, cushioned comfort\n\tGrippy rubber sole offers no-slip traction\n\tThe Nike Air Griffey Max 1 Casual Shoes are imported.\n\n\nWorn for both casual and cross training, the Boys' Big Kids' Nike Air Griffey Max 1 Training Shoes hit any look out of the park. Featuring a team of highlight-worthy specs - such as sporty colorblocking, non-stop comfort and next-level looks - they'll become your kiddo's go-to sneaker no matter where he's headed. Finished with former MLB outfield player's, Ken Griffey Jr., number at the hook-and-loop strap, these are great for the sneakerhead, superfan and casual shoe wearer.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Boys' Big Kids' Nike Air Griffey Max 1 Training Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Boys'</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Grade School</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/Black/Fresh Water/Varsity Red</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufactu